     "titulo": "Departures and arrivals",
     "texto": [
      "**Odjeżdża** means «leaves» and **przyjeżdża**, «arrives», when we talk about a vehicle.",
      "**Pociąg odjeżdża o ósmej** means «The train leaves at eight»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Duration",
     "texto": [
      "**Podróż trwa dwie godziny** means «The journey lasts two hours».",
      "The number **dwie** agrees with **godziny**, which is feminine."
